menu "e32p: ble"

    config E32P_BLE_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_ble (BLE GATT peripheral over NimBLE)"
        default n
        help
            BLE peripheral facade: advertise a named device with one custom
            service and characteristics (read/write/notify). The advertising
            payload assembly and UUID helpers are pure and unit-tested headless.
            The radio path is compiled only when the NimBLE host is enabled
            (Component config -> Bluetooth -> Bluetooth enabled + Host = NimBLE,
            i.e. CONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED). Without it, the device functions return
            ESP_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED so the module still builds in radio-free targets.

endmenu
